ula_silicon: "Dedicated Ferranti 5C/6C ULA (~1,140 gates used of ~1,200-1,400; legacy 0xFE I/O, tape EAR/MIC, and bit-scrambled bitmap logic removed)"
package: "40-pin PDIP (13p DDS crossbar + 6p 2114 Index SRAM + 9p RGB332/CSYNC + 4p clk/pwr/rst + 8p spare/MMIO/coder ctrl)"
